{"title":"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Karen has just been chosen the new “Math Idol”. A total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/9/ad981f772c6efc440bb066786651ec0922c663a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,480,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" /> votes were cast and Karen received <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/2/0229bb0357ba5e625b69cf9943790dc89f478afd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$83\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of them. How many people voted for her?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/1/e718a8c73fbdfcf04029215ddc64812b85be7d0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 830,000 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 1,228,400 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 1,100,000 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 251,600 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 1,783,132$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"649\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/2/0229bb0357ba5e625b69cf9943790dc89f478afd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$83\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> in decimal form is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/c/64cf16a31677fac029399a35469587ffd8ca60cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.83$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />, then the number of people who voted for Karen is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/b/cbb78410133261b87a291ec361ebe108cf8c0a6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.83\\times 1,480,000 = 1,228,400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"237\" height=\"16\" />.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005